<Base title="Preview privacy notice" noindex><section class="page-hero"><div class="container page-title-only"><span class="eyebrow">Website privacy</span><h1>Privacy in this local preview.</h1><p class="intro">The commercial inquiry channel is not active. The legal operator and final privacy details must be confirmed before personal inquiries are accepted.</p></div></section><section class="section-space"><div class="container article-body"><h2>Current preview behavior</h2><p>This website serves product information and synthetic explanatory content. Inquiry forms remain disabled until an approved operator, privacy notice and lead destination are configured. Disabled forms do not submit or save your entries. Do not enter candidate records, examination content or confidential information.</p><h2>Technical operation</h2><p>The local server processes connection information to serve pages. Form security, when activated, uses a short-lived same-site security cookie and in-memory request limiting. No advertising, third-party analytics or marketing subscription is enabled by default. Product walkthrough data is synthetic.</p><h2>Before the inquiry channel opens</h2><p>The final notice must identify the legal controller, contact details, inquiry purposes, legal basis, processors and data locations, retention, rights and complaint route. Management must approve the configured CRM, email and meeting services and test access, deletion and delivery.</p><h2>Product deployments</h2><p>This notice concerns the marketing website. Candidate and proctoring data in a Smart Exam deployment requires its own agreed notices, processing terms, access and retention arrangements.</p></div></section></Base>
